WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:16.903
Tom listened to Cat's idea.

2
00:00:16.904 --> 00:00:25.044
Then he went into the Dining Hall.

3
00:00:25.045 --> 00:00:29.118
"Where's our food?" the king cried.

4
00:00:29.119 --> 00:00:32.200
"You have eaten it all," Tom said.

5
00:00:32.201 --> 00:00:35.019
"What?" the king shouted.

6
00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:37.702
Tom gulped.

7
00:00:37.703 --> 00:00:44.509
"More food!" the guests yelled.

8
00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:47.601
"I have an idea," Tom began.

9
00:00:47.602 --> 00:00:51.116
"Cat is the best mouse hunter in the kingdom.

10
00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:54.166
So Cook can bake a mouse pie."

11
00:00:54.167 --> 00:01:00.636
"A mouse pie?" the king said.

12
00:01:00.637 --> 00:01:05.547
The Dining Hall got very quiet.

13
00:01:05.548 --> 00:01:10.223
"I'm not hungry," the king said in a small voice.

14
00:01:10.224 --> 00:01:13.752
"Me neither," some lords mumbled.

15
00:01:13.753 --> 00:01:18.023
The queen hurried into the Dining Hall.

16
00:01:18.024 --> 00:01:21.850
"Did I miss the feast?" she asked.

17
00:01:21.851 --> 00:01:25.880
"I have been reading a wonderful book about food!"

18
00:01:25.881 --> 00:01:29.058
She waved a book in the air.

19
00:01:29.059 --> 00:01:33.759
Cook gasped. "My cookbook!"

20
00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:37.046
"Is it yours?" the queen asked.

21
00:01:37.047 --> 00:01:45.814
"I found it in the hallway."

22
00:01:45.815 --> 00:01:49.040
Cook did a curtsy.

23
00:01:49.041 --> 00:01:51.932
"Thank you, Your Majesty!

24
00:01:51.933 --> 00:01:55.059
I can make a new feast tomorrow.

25
00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:58.056
It will be delicious!"

26
00:01:58.057 --> 00:02:03.747
"A new feast?" The king groaned.

27
00:02:03.748 --> 00:02:06.421
"I don't want another feast.

28
00:02:06.422 --> 00:02:14.386
I want a nap!"

29
00:02:14.387 --> 00:02:25.447
The next day Cook made a feast just for Tom.

30
00:02:25.448 --> 00:02:29.524
"Mmm. Delicious!" Tom said.

31
00:02:29.525 --> 00:02:35.268
"Thank you, Cook!"

32
00:02:35.269 --> 00:02:39.173
"And here's something for Cat," Cook said.

33
00:02:39.174 --> 00:02:42.099
She set down a bowl.

34
00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:58.258
"Milk is almost as good as mouse pie!"

